From a617c492f2a67fc326b5d5cfb766ce2ce9ed0ecd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:58:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Map sounds only from an area around the centre of the
 view

A large screen draws many more objects than the original's 320x200 one,
and each of them can play its sounds: they overlapped. Buildings, serfs,
trees and water now sound only inside Viewport::hear_width x hear_height
(default 320x200) around the centre; 0 restores the whole view.
---
 src/viewport.cc | 76 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 src/viewport.h  | 13 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/viewport.cc b/src/viewport.cc
